          "text": "普尔回传库里，库里沿左侧突破。",
          "audio_start_sec": 35.1,
          "audio_end_sec": 37.9560625,
          "source_evidence": [
            {
              "start_sec": 5,
              "end_sec": 11
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "P03_03",
          "text": "篮下先虚晃，再起身把球打进。",
          "audio_start_sec": 41.35,
          "audio_end_sec": 43.88097916666667,
          "source_evidence": [
            {
              "start_sec": 11,
              "end_sec": 14
